<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/msa@/~cl_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Akta ini bolehlah dinamakan Akta Seri Pahlawan Gagah Perkasa (Elaun Kenangan) (Pindaan) 2001. Pindaan seksyen 3"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/msa@/~cl_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/msa@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/msa@/~cl_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/msa@> .
