<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/msa@/~cl_4__subsec_2__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "menjadi amaun yang kena dibayar kepada seseorang penerima; dan"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/msa@/~cl_4__subsec_2__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/msa@/~cl_4__subsec_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/51/msa@> .
